    "1 部屋あたり約 13 円。似た箱詰め・クレーンのゲームの買い切り（$2.99〜$9.99）より安くしています。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About ¥13 per room. Priced below similar packing and claw games ($2.99–$9.99)."
